#ASSERT `s 1033(6) the company has failed to comply with subsection (5)(a) or (c)` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (Date 1 6 2026) (JUST (Date 10 6 2026)) FALSE (Date 20 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
