-- (7) summary conviction: level 5 on the standard scale; daily default fine one-tenth of level 5. Pounds are not in the Act.
#ASSERT `s 1033(7) the penalty for a person guilty of an offence under section 1033(6), on the first wording` EQUALS Penalty OF `on summary conviction`, NOTHING, (JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 5 1)), (JUST (`a fine not exceeding a level on the standard scale` 5 0.1)), FALSE
-- the second wording the text carries: one-tenth of the greater of 5,000 pounds or level 4
#ASSERT `s 1033(7) the daily default fine on the second wording` EQUALS `s 1033(7) one-tenth of the greater of a sum and a level on the standard scale` OF 5000, 4
#ASSERT NOT (`s 1033(7) the daily default fine on the second wording` EQUALS `s 1033(7) one-tenth of the greater of a sum and a level on the standard scale` OF 500, 4)

